```

Verification tokens must not remain reusable after confirmation.

---

## Download Token

Created when:

```text
Email verification succeeds
```

Recommended expiry:

```text
24 hours
```

Maximum successful downloads:

```text
3
```

Invalidated when:

```text
Token expires
OR
Maximum download count reached
```

Expired records should periodically be cleaned from storage where appropriate.

