# Desired Outcome

After implementation, a legitimate recruiter should experience:

```text
Enter email
     ↓
Complete/pass Turnstile
     ↓
Check inbox
     ↓
Confirm email
     ↓
Download CV
```

The entire process should take less than a minute.

At the same time:

```text
Random visitor
      ✕ cannot trigger unlimited emails

Bot
      ✕ cannot easily automate requests

Unknown third party
      ✕ cannot request the CV for someone else and receive it

Crawler
      ✕ cannot discover a permanent CV URL

Leaked verification token
      ✕ cannot remain permanently valid

Old download token
      ✕ cannot provide indefinite CV access

Database token leak
      ✕ should not immediately reveal raw access tokens
```

The final result should preserve the character and usability of `aniqsaidi.my` while substantially improving its **privacy, abuse resistance, CV access control, and overall security posture**.